    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Product Feedback — setup\n1. Import this workflow into n8n (Workflows → Import from file).\n2. Open `Webhook: product-feedback` → Method POST, Path `product-feedback`.\n3. Production URL must be `https://pranav277.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/product-feedback` (use Production URL, not Test URL).\n4. Workflow must be **Active** for Production URL to return 200 (Test URL only works while listening).\n5. CORS: n8n Cloud auto-responds to OPTIONS. If self-hosted, set `N8N_CORS_ALLOW_ORIGIN=*` or your Vercel domain.\n6. Connect `Normalize feedback` → Google Sheets / Notion / Slack / AI Agent as needed.\n7. Frontend posts the flat contract: `{ id, source, user_segment, date, rating, feedback }` (+ `email` only when the user provides one; ignored until a store/use step is added). Only `feedback` is mandatory.",
